flowchart LR
    U[Usuario / navegador] --> AP[AP ESP32-Firewall-Lab]
    AP --> WS[WebServer.h sincrono]

    WS --> HTML[Paginas HTML embarcadas]
    WS --> API[APIs JSON]
    WS --> FW[Firewall didatico]
    WS --> IDS[IDS didatico]

    HTML --> DASH[Dashboard / demo / gateway / logs]
    API --> STATUS[/api/status]
    API --> EVENTS[/api/events]
    API --> PERSISTENT[/api/events/persistent]

    FW --> RAM[Buffer de eventos em RAM]
    IDS --> RAM
    WS --> RAM
    RAM --> LOGS[Paginas /logs e /eventos]
    RAM --> LFS[LittleFS /events.log]
    LFS --> PERSISTENT

    WS --> GW[Gateway AP+STA didatico]
    GW --> APINFO[Telemetria do AP]
    GW --> STA[Upstream Wi-Fi opcional]
    GW --> NAT[NAT real nao implementado]

    MET[Tasks FreeRTOS de metricas] --> STATUS
    MET --> ENERGY[INA219 preparado]
    FUT[Sensores fisicos futuros] -. fase final .-> MET
    FUT -. DHT22 / MQ-2 .-> MET

    SMOKE[Smoke tester externo] --> AP
